# POC for ath12k

First time:
## Get FW QCA:
```sh
wget "https://git.codelinaro.org/clo/ath-firmware/ath12k-firmware/-/archive/main/ath12k-firmware-main.zip"
unzip ath12k-firmware-main.zip
wget https://github.com/qca/qca-swiss-army-knife/raw/master/tools/scripts/ath12k/ath12k-fw-repo
chmod +x ath12k-fw-repo
cd ath12k-firmware-main
../ath12k-fw-repo --install /nfsexport/lib/firmware/
cp QCN9274/hw2.0/regdb.bin /nfsexport/lib/firmware/ath12k/QCN9274/hw2.0/
```


## Compile kernel and modules:
Go to `/home/<user>/devices_build_siklu-arm64/tmp/work-shared/siklu-arm64/kernel-source`
```sh
git checkout shmuel-ath12k-expr
export CROSS_COMPILE=../../../work/siklu_arm64-poky-linux/linux-arm64/5.10.110-r0/recipe-sysroot-native/usr/bin/aarch64-poky-linux/aarch64-poky-linux-
cp siklu_arm64_defconfig .config
make ARCH=arm64 oldconfig
make ARCH=arm64 -j 12
cp arm64/boot/Image /nfsexport/boot/
cp -L ../../../../tmp/deploy/images/siklu-arm64/armada-8040-n366.dtb  /nfsexport/boot/
cp drivers/soc/qcom/qmi_helpers.ko  /nfsexport/lib/modules/
```

## On device
```
echo 8 > /proc/sys/kernel/printk
insmod /lib/modules/qmi_helpers.ko
insmod /lib/modules/ath12k.ko  debug_mask=0xffffffff board_name=bus=pci,qmi-chip-id=0,qmi-board-id=30
```

## compile
Go to `/home/<user>/devices_build_siklu-arm64/tmp/work-shared/siklu-arm64/kernel-source`
Run:
```
export CROSS_COMPILE=../../../work/siklu_arm64-poky-linux/linux-arm64/5.10.110-r0/recipe-sysroot-native/usr/bin/aarch64-poky-linux/aarch64-poky-linux-
make ARCH=arm64 -j 12
cp drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/ath12k.ko  /nfsexport/lib/modules/
```

